  "issue": {
    "id": "I_kwDOBiM5Uc8AAAABGs8VUQ",
    "databaseId": 4744746321,
    "number": 3416,
    "title": "Spawning controllers with type declaration",
    "url": "https://github.com/ros-controls/ros2_control/issues/3416",
    "body": "**Describe the bug**\nThere was a possibility to use `--type` flag during spawning controller using `ros2 run controller_manager spawner`.\nHow to declare the type of the controller during spawning? \n\n**To Reproduce**\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\n1. Run\n`ros2 launch gz_ros2_control_demos  diff_drive_example.launch.py `\n`ros2 run controller_manager spawner  joint_trajectory_controller` (-t joint_trajectory_controller JointTrajectoryController)\n\n**Expected behavior**\nPossibility to load the controller with not previously declared type.\n\n**Screenshots**\n\n<img width=\"1344\" height=\"28\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1f934440-3320-42bf-8f51-62b12482a407\" />\n\n**Environment (please complete the following information):**\n - OS: Ubuntu 24.4\n - Version  jazzy\n\n\n\n",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Describe the bug</strong><br>\nThere was a possibility to use <code class=\"notranslate\">--type</code> flag during spawning controller using <code class=\"notranslate\">ros2 run controller_manager spawner</code>.<br>\nHow to declare the type of the controller during spawning?</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>To Reproduce</strong><br>\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Run<br>\n<code class=\"notranslate\">ros2 launch gz_ros2_control_demos  diff_drive_example.launch.py </code><br>\n<code class=\"notranslate\">ros2 run controller_manager spawner  joint_trajectory_controller</code> (-t joint_trajectory_controller JointTrajectoryController)</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Expected behavior</strong><br>\nPossibility to load the controller with not previously declared type.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Screenshots</strong></p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/109142865/613165652-1f934440-3320-42bf-8f51-62b12482a407.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTE3MTgxNzAsIm5iZiI6MTc5MTcxNzg3MCwicGF0aCI6Ii8xMDkxNDI4NjUvNjEzMTY1NjUyLTFmOTM0NDQwLTMzMjAtNDJiZi04ZjUxLTYyYjEyNDgyYTQwNy5wbmc_.sUWOK0u09JaTqOrTL0K3o0PZh501cItSEk88LycoNWE\"><img width=\"1344\" height=\"28\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/109142865/613165652-1f934440-3320-42bf-8f51-62b12482a407.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTE3MTgxNzAsIm5iZiI6MTc5MTcxNzg3MCwicGF0aCI6Ii8xMDkxNDI4NjUvNjEzMTY1NjUyLTFmOTM0NDQwLTMzMjAtNDJiZi04ZjUxLTYyYjEyNDgyYTQwNy5wbmc_.sUWOK0u09JaTqOrTL0K3o0PZh501cItSEk88LycoNWE\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 28px;; aspect-ratio: 1344 / 28; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Environment (please complete the following information):</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>OS: Ubuntu 24.4</li>\n<li>Version  jazzy</li>\n</ul>",
